    "detailed_description": "<i>Please note: 2 controllers required for 2 player split screen mode.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hot Wheels\u2122 Monster Trucks are ready to unleash mayhem on the competition!</h2><br>Hot Wheels\u2122 Monster Trucks are ready to GO BIG and perform insane stunts while smashing and bashing through fantastical arenas in a new game that brings your favorite monster trucks to your fingertips!<br><br><strong>Key Game Features:</strong><br><br>\u2022 Real-world Hot Wheels\u2122 Monster Trucks, ready to drive and perform exhilarating stunts. <br><br>\u2022 Thrilling bosses like Crushzilla\u2122 and fan-favorite Stunt Zone by Night arena are all set in thrilling arcade gameplay!<br><br>\u2022 Head-to-Head Multiplayer challenges to see who\u2019s got the best skills and the highest scores in the arena!<br><br>\u2022 20 fan-favorite Hot Wheels\u2122 Monster Trucks, each with additional skins and truly spectacular Signature Moves to perform!<br><br>\u2022 Gripping Single Player Modes: Career, Stunt, Destruction, and Boss Mode.<br><br>\u2022 Infinite replayability to perfect combos and send scores to the moon.",
